# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
# Don't let the broad Python `lib/` rule above swallow frontend or
# landing source directories that happen to be named `lib`. Both
# `frontend/src/lib/` and `landing/src/lib/` house runtime helpers
# (native.ts, gsap.ts, etc.) and ARE source. Without these escape
# hatches the Vercel build of the landing site fails with
# `Module not found: @/lib/gsap` because the file silently never
# gets committed and so never reaches the deploy mirror.
!frontend/src/lib/
!frontend/src/lib/**
!landing/src/lib/
!landing/src/lib/**
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

